{title: Ye Jism Hai To Kya}
{artist: Ali Azmat Arko}
{key: Em}

{c: Verse 1}
Ye [Em]jism hai to kya ye rooh ka libas hai
Ye [D]dard hai to kya ye ishq ki talash hai
[C]Fanaa kiya mujhe, ye chahne ki aas ne,        [D]Taraa taraa [Em]shikast hi hua
[Em]Raza hai kya teri dilo Jahan tabah kiya
[D]Sazaa bhi kya teri wafa ko bewafa kiya
[C]Wah re zindagi, se yun mujhe juda kiya,        [D]Kahaan Kahaan, [Em]phirun main dhoondta
[Em]Raza hai kya teri dilo Jahan tabah kiya
[D]Sazaa bhi kya teri wafa ko bewafa kiya
[C]Wah re zindagi, se yun mujhe juda kiya,        [D]Kahaan Kahaan, [Em]phirun main dhoondta
[Em]Wahaan jahaan tuhi mera libaas hai,        [D]Wahaan jahaan teri hi bas talash hai
[C]Wahaan jahaan tujhi pe khatam aas hai,        [D]Wahin shuru [Em]wahin pe dafan jaan hai
